0.04 0.48 0.22 rg
BT /F2 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 775.53 Tm (The principles) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 760.88 Tm (Keep as little as possible. What is not there cannot leak. We do not ask for data we do not need and keep nothing) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 746.48 Tm (longer than the purpose we hold it for.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 728.68 Tm (A workspace is a boundary. Every request is checked against workspace and role; there is no screen where) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 714.28 Tm (another client's data could appear by accident.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 696.48 Tm (A key you give us is yours. Keys for Odoo, Meta, Google or your social channels are stored encrypted, never) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 682.08 Tm (shown back, never written to a log line and never sent to an AI model.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 664.28 Tm (Administrator access is temporary and leaves a trail. There is no permanent administrator session in a client) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 649.88 Tm (environment.) Tj ET
0.04 0.48 0.22 rg
BT /F2 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 628.08 Tm (Access) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 613.43 Tm (Signing in to an account runs through an identity provider with two-step verification. Administrator access at) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 599.03 Tm (SocialNow runs through a passkey, with a time-based code as fallback on a new device.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 581.23 Tm (When an administrator opens a client environment, it happens with a token valid for two minutes that opens that) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 566.83 Tm (one system only and that is judged by that system itself. The token never appears in a log; its issuance does, with) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 552.43 Tm (who, which system and when.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 534.63 Tm (Rights are granted per workspace. When someone leaves, their access is withdrawn; in the OS you do that) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 520.23 Tm (yourself under Team.) Tj ET
0.04 0.48 0.22 rg
BT /F2 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 498.43 Tm (Encryption) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 483.78 Tm (All traffic runs over TLS. Anyone arriving over http is redirected to https.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 465.98 Tm (Data is stored encrypted at our providers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 448.18 Tm (Secrets live only in the hosting provider's environment. They are not in the source code and not in a configuration) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 433.78 Tm (file that travels in version control.) Tj ET
0.04 0.48 0.22 rg
BT /F2 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 411.98 Tm (The software itself) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 397.33 Tm (All code is under version control. Every deployment traces back to a commit and can be rolled back.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 379.53 Tm (An automated test suite of more than two thousand tests runs before every deployment. A failing suite means no) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 365.13 Tm (deployment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 347.33 Tm (A strict Content Security Policy determines which scripts, styles and connections a page may use. A script of) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 332.93 Tm (unknown origin does not run, even if it found its way in.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 315.13 Tm (Dependencies are checked for known vulnerabilities. A vulnerability of high severity or above blocks deployment) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 300.73 Tm (until it is resolved.) Tj ET
0.04 0.48 0.22 rg
BT /F2 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 278.93 Tm (Monitoring) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 264.28 Tm (Consequential actions - granting access, opening a system, changing a key - are recorded in an audit trail.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 246.48 Tm (Errors and warnings are collected centrally. Personal data is not written into them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 228.68 Tm (The reachability and login protection of every client system is checked automatically and continuously. If a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 214.28 Tm (system serves its home page without a login, that appears as an alarm on the administration screen.) Tj ET
0.04 0.48 0.22 rg
BT /F2 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 192.48 Tm (If something does go wrong) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 177.83 Tm (We notify the client concerned of a personal data breach within 24 hours of discovery, with what happened, what) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 163.43 Tm (it likely affects, what we have done and where to reach us. That is shorter than the 72 hours the GDPR gives you,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 149.03 Tm (so you can make your own assessment with time to spare.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 131.23 Tm (We keep a register of breaches, including those that did not have to be notified.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 113.43 Tm (We do not notify the supervisory authority on your behalf unless you ask us in writing. You are the controller; that) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 99.03 Tm (notification is your decision.) Tj ET
