0.04 0.48 0.22 rg
BT /F2 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 775.53 Tm (Reporting a vulnerability) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 760.88 Tm (If you find something, report it to security@socialnow.nl. Describe what you found, where, and how it can be) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 746.48 Tm (demonstrated. A screenshot or a short set of steps helps.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 728.68 Tm (What you may expect from us: a reply from a person within three working days, an assessment of severity within) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 714.28 Tm (ten working days, and word when it is fixed. If you report responsibly and do not abuse what you found, we will) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 699.88 Tm (not report you to the police and will not hold you liable. If you want to be credited in the fix, we are happy to.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 682.08 Tm (What we ask of you: do not view, copy, alter or delete other people's data; do not take a service down; no social) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 667.68 Tm (engineering, phishing or physical access; no automated scanning that loads the system; and do not share the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 653.28 Tm (flaw before it is fixed. If you unintentionally reach other people's data, stop and say so in your report.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 635.48 Tm (We do not pay a bounty. What we do is answer fast and fix fast.) Tj ET
0.04 0.48 0.22 rg
BT /F2 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 613.68 Tm (What we do not do) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 599.03 Tm (We hold no ISO 27001 or SOC 2 certification. SocialNow is a small company; such a certification says more) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 584.63 Tm (about the budget for auditors right now than about the security itself. What we do do is written above, and Annex) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 570.23 Tm (B of the data processing agreement sets it out as a list you can walk through.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 552.43 Tm (We do not make session recordings of users. It is technically possible and we deliberately switched it off.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 534.63 Tm (We have no back door into a client system. Access always runs through the short-lived token that the client) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 520.23 Tm (system judges itself.) Tj ET
